<title>UK: Jardine Fleming wins $60 mln Achmea fund mandate.</title>
<headline>Jardine Fleming wins $60 mln Achmea fund mandate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming Investment Management said on Friday it had won a $60 million mandate to manage funds in Asia for Dutch banking and insurance group Achmea.</p>
<p>It said it would manage equities on an active basis in a Japanese and an Asia ex-Japan portfolio.</p>
<p>JFIM has assets under management of about $20 billion.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
</text>
